 "analysis_en": [
  "On the morning of Oct 15, SJC bars were quoted at 140.3–143.3 million VND per tael and SJC rings at 139.8–142.8 million – flat vs the Oct 14 close (vang.today and VietNamNet). That is 1 million below yesterday morning’s posted board (141.3–144.3 million) after the Oct 14 decline.",
  "World gold is around $4,140/oz, ≈ 129.2 million VND per tael converted; the SJC ask premium over world gold is ≈ 14.1 million VND – still wide, though a touch narrower than the ≈ 14.8 million noted yesterday morning.",
  "A buyer at the 191.3 million VND peak ask (Jan 29, 2026) selling back today at the 140.3 million bid would be down about 51 million VND per tael (≈ 27%).",
  "The local market is holding after the Oct 14 drop while the world price still swings after US CPI; US PPI and retail sales are due tonight (VN time) – new buyers still face a double risk from the international price and the wide premium."
 ],
